{"unit_id":"Tongyu3__dsh-pet-android#card-zh","repo":"Tongyu3/dsh-pet-android","commit":"a85b67e1aee7975be80dcdaac4b4c705b045182e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet-android 是面向 Android 移植版 DSH 的桌宠显示插件，通过 DSH WebServer 提供控制面板和透明宠物页面，并将窗口快照写入宿主可读取的文件通道；在 DSHA 上还可自动切换到 3090 文本悬浮条。它读取上游 dsh-pet 的宠物配置、动画、状态和素材，在宿主支持窗口契约时显示完整桌宠，支持多宠物窗口、动画、拖动抛掷、气泡及状态同步，也可显示宠物说话文本。适合希望在 Android 屏幕上持续看到 DSH 桌宠的用户。需要预先安装 dsh-pet；完整悬浮窗还要求宿主实现窗口契约并负责悬浮权限。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:132-145","src/index.js:224-250","src/carrier.js:48-73","src/overlay/overlay.js:327-396","src/overlay/overlay.js:481-515"]}
{"unit_id":"Tongyu3__dsh-pet-android#card-en","repo":"Tongyu3/dsh-pet-android","commit":"a85b67e1aee7975be80dcdaac4b4c705b045182e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pet-android displays DSH pets on Android through a host file channel, with a DSHA text overlay fallback. It reads pet state from dsh-pet and supports animation, dragging, speech bubbles, and updates. Install dsh-pet first; full windows require a compatible host that manages overlay permission.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:132-145","src/index.js:224-250","src/carrier.js:48-73","src/overlay/overlay.js:327-396","src/overlay/overlay.js:481-515"]}
