{"unit_id":"Tongyu3__dsh-pet-android#feature-1","repo":"Tongyu3/dsh-pet-android","commit":"a85b67e1aee7975be80dcdaac4b4c705b045182e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet-android 的功能「宿主悬浮窗同步」：把启用状态、页面地址和各宠物窗口组成快照，经文件通道交给 Android 宿主创建、更新或关闭窗口。内容变化才递增代数并以临时文件重命名发布。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:260-297","src/carrier.js:48-73"]}
{"unit_id":"Tongyu3__dsh-pet-android#feature-2","repo":"Tongyu3/dsh-pet-android","commit":"a85b67e1aee7975be80dcdaac4b4c705b045182e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet-android 的功能「DSHA 文本悬浮条」：检测本机 3090 桥，并把上游宠物状态中的说话内容送到文本悬浮条；窗口载体已生效时可自动停用，避免重复显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:224-250","src/adapters/dsha.js:56-78"]}
{"unit_id":"Tongyu3__dsh-pet-android#feature-3","repo":"Tongyu3/dsh-pet-android","commit":"a85b67e1aee7975be80dcdaac4b4c705b045182e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet-android 的功能「宠物动画与互动」：透明页面读取上游宠物动画状态并播放动画，用户可拖动宠物并抛掷；页面还会展示宠物说话气泡。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/overlay/overlay.js:327-396","src/overlay/overlay.js:453-515"]}
{"unit_id":"Tongyu3__dsh-pet-android#feature-4","repo":"Tongyu3/dsh-pet-android","commit":"a85b67e1aee7975be80dcdaac4b4c705b045182e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet-android 的功能「控制与状态面板」：通过插件路由打开控制页、查看载体和宿主状态，并用开关或设置接口控制显示及布局参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:314-375","src/index.js:378-394"]}
{"unit_id":"Tongyu3__dsh-pet-android#caveat-1","repo":"Tongyu3/dsh-pet-android","commit":"a85b67e1aee7975be80dcdaac4b4c705b045182e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet-android 使用前须知：完整 Android 悬浮窗由宿主创建并负责权限；插件只提交窗口请求，不申请或引导悬浮权限。DSHA 的文本悬浮条权限和开关也归 DSHA 管理。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/carrier.js:4-9","src/adapters/dsha.js:10-16"]}
{"unit_id":"Tongyu3__dsh-pet-android#caveat-2","repo":"Tongyu3/dsh-pet-android","commit":"a85b67e1aee7975be80dcdaac4b4c705b045182e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet-android 使用前须知：宠物配置与素材来自上游 dsh-pet；需先安装并启用该插件，且页面依赖其配置和状态路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/overlay/overlay.js:481-515","src/overlay/overlay.js:574-595"]}
